@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@accessToken = replace-with-local-access-token
@collectionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Upload an image, add it to the collection, and set it as the preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PreviewBoundary

--PreviewBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="preview.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./preview.jpg
--PreviewBoundary--
